A new criterion for integral modular categorification
Jingcheng Dong and Sébastien Palcoux

Code, data and instructions for reproducing the computations in the paper
https://github.com/sebastienpalcoux/Fusion-Categories/blob/main/NewCritPaper/python/README.md

Run python3 reproduce.py and python3 verify.py from the python/ directory
with Python 3.9 or later. The programs use only the standard library.
The input tables and the 358 surviving rank-15 types are in python/data/.

Version20260715.pdf and Rank15/ accompany the earlier version of the paper.
